0027 keyword mappings to profiling-hosts\n+    public static final int INDEX_TEMPLATE_VERSION \u003d 7;","submitted_line":51},"generatedCommentsNodes":[{"comment":"The version numbers are incremented, but there is no corresponding change log or documentation update to explain what has changed in this new version. Consider adding a changelog entry or updating the documentation to reflect these changes.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/profiling/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/profiling/ProfilingIndexTemplateRegistry.java-x-pack/plugin/profiling/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/profiling/ProfilingIndexTemplateRegistry.java-2474:2475-2580:2581","promptId":"#E0G0G","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/profiling/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/profiling/ProfilingIndexTemplateRegistry.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/profiling/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/profiling/ProfilingIndexTemplateRegistry.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":2474,"endPos":2475,"startLine":50,"startLineOffset":53,"endLine":50,"endLineOffset":54,"length":2}],"dstChanges":[{"pos":2580,"endPos":2581,"startLine":51,"startLineOffset":53,"endLine":51,"endLineOffset":54,"length":2}]},{"id":"x-pack/plugin/profiling/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/profiling/ProfilingIndexTemplateRegistry.java-x-pack/plugin/profiling/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/profiling/ProfilingIndexTemplateRegistry.java--2425:2526","promptId":"#J1ATP","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/profiling/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/profiling/ProfilingIndexTemplateRegistry.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/profiling/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/profiling/ProfilingIndexTemplateRegistry.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":2425,"endPos":2526,"startLine":50,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":50,"endLineOffset":105,"length":102}]},{"id":"x-pack/plugin/profiling/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/profiling/ProfilingIndexTemplateRegistry.java-x-pack/plugin/profiling/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/profiling/ProfilingIndexTe